"kind":"announcement","title":"TOUGH PIXEL ART in Kopernicus","summary":"Dear Incremental Sufferrers! I know it tooks some time for to return with Kopernicus demo update - but here it is (and also the demo which is coming out on October 7th is almosi here). In the meantime, I wanted to share something a little different: a behind-the-scenes look at the artistic constraints I've imposed on myself while making Kopernicus. So like with every game I start with the sketchbook. But then I go like: No rotation. Three colors. 480 × 270 pixels. Why make life easier when you c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T17:19:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4456460-1833968530887538","game_id":"steam-4456460","kind":"announcement","title":"Kopernicus revealed during BitSummit14 in Kyoto","summary":"My dear friends, I’ve just returned from Kyoto, where I had the pleasure of announcing my game during BitSummit14. Thank you to everyone among the 68,000 visitors who took the time to visit my booth and play Kopernicus: Extraction. I also want to thank you for all the feedback you shared with me. Thanks to your comments, I’m sure the demo coming to Steam will be much better.ːsteamthisːThis was already another time I’ve visited Kyoto, and I definitely don’t regret coming back. During the day I sp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T09:15:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4456460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:55